# Personal GitHub Account
## Config
Host personal.github.com
  HostName github.com
  PreferredAuthentications publickey
  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_desktop_personal

## Commands
  ### cd ~/.ssh
  ### ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f id_ed25519_desktop_personal -C "desktop@PC-DESKTOP.local" -N '""'
  ### cat id_ed25519_desktop_personal.pub
  ### ssh -T git@personal.github.com
  ### git clone git@personal.github.com:username/repo.git

