# NOTES
## New machine set up
  ### The ssh-key file format is id_algorithm_machine_account
  ### The comment format is "user@machine.local"
  ### Find and replace _machine_ in config file
  ### Fine and replace _account in config file
  ### Replace comment with new machine hostname

